<title>ISRAEL: Israel December trade deficit at $994 million.</title>
<headline>Israel December trade deficit at $994 million.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's trade deficit in December 1996 totalled $994 million, the Central Bureau of Statistics said on Sunday.</p>
<p>	     Dec 96    Nov 96     Dec 95</p>
<p>Exports    1,635     1,741	1,716</p>
<p>Imports    2,628     2,243	2,639</p>
<p>Balance     -994	-503	 -923</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in millions of dollars.</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
